WEBVTT

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.060
Are you an idiot?

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:16.360
Shut yer mouth!

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.330
Kaito, don't move!

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.600
Oh, sorry 'bout that.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.300
Jeez, you really are kinda strange.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.370
Suddenly wanting to paint Kaito...

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:32.770
I, Ana, think I see something scary!

00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:33.670
Where, where?

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:34.680
Huh?!

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:37.670
What the heck is that?!

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:39.570
It's Kaito.

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:41.060
That ain't me!

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:43.600
I'm not sure if it's human or not.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.030
But it's Kaito all right.

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:48.700
Right, bird friends?

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:53.820
Jeez, I just can't count on you, can I?

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.050
You're way too free, Ana.

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:05.250
"Free"...

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:07.340
It makes me sick to my stomach.

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:24.890
Lost

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:28.020
Tesaguri de sagashiteta
I've searched, groping

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:31.940
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
The answer to a future that's been closed off

00:01:31.940 --> 00:01:33.860
Tozasareta mirai no kotae nante doko nimo nai
Is nowhere to be found

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:37.200
Hashiru shoudou, ima kaidoku funou
The impulse to run, it's impossible to decipher now

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:38.910
Found

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:43.160
Kudaketa hazu no unmei o
A fate that was supposedly smashed

00:01:43.160 --> 00:01:47.620
Mijuku na yume no naka de kikoeta kitanda
I've come to hear it within that half-formed dream:

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:50.460
Saigo made I'll be there for you
Until the end, I'll be there for you

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:53.550
Tachidomaranai, kono hari dake wa
It won't stop, not this needle

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:56.880
Boku no asu o kizamu oto o tsukisasu
It will pierce the sound that engraves my tomorrow

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.800
Shinjitsu kara nigetara ima
If I run from the truth, then now...

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.510
Genjitsu ni mo maketara ima
If I lose to reality, then now...

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:02.850
Nani ga nokoru no?
What will remain?

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:05.060
(Nokoru no?)
(Will remain?)

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:07.430
Kazoekirenai kono kizu dake ga
These countless wounds of mine

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:10.900
Boku no kinou o zanzou to shite kataru
They tell of my yesterday as an afterimage

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:12.610
Unmei ga hodoketemo ima
Even if fate were unraveled, now...

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:14.440
Sonzai o kowashitemo ima
Even if my existence were smashed, now...

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:17.320
Boku no michi o yuku yo
I will travel my path

00:02:17.860 --> 00:02:19.450
It's now or never

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:20.530
That is what they say

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:22.620
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:26.290
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:27.450
That is what they say

00:02:27.450 --> 00:02:29.620
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:33.130
There will always be,
there will always be a way

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:34.340
That is what they say

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:36.760
Live your life today, yeah, yeah

00:02:39.150 --> 00:02:43.010
The Pieces of Hatred

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.010
If we lost to Kaito Daimon and his crew,

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.980
you would approach them no more.

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:52.150
Such was the promise, yes?

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.750
Pathetic.

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:56.570
Promises are made to be broken.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:00.280
Honestly, I'm fed up with all of you.

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:05.110
Why did Mr. Klondike make me,
with whom the future rests,

00:03:05.110 --> 00:03:07.080
the director of you lot?

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:12.000
For me, winning or losing the game
was never the issue.

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:15.710
It's revenge that I seek.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:19.840
That's what you called
me here to talk about?

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.210
It's time to introduce you.

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:27.310
To the next game player, that is.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:46.720
Will you allow me to accompany her?

00:03:47.050 --> 00:03:48.450
As you wish.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:50.580
Learn well.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:54.190
And make Kaito and his companions

00:03:54.190 --> 00:03:57.250
know ignominy and despair
greater than death!

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:08.690
Okay, that's it for this interim report.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.260
This is where we stand on our analysis of

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:14.980
the new-model Replica Ring that Rook gave us.

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.610
"Where we stand," huh?

00:04:18.490 --> 00:04:20.250
What kinda stand is that?

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.090
I don't get this at all!

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:24.060
In a word, it's incredible!

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.280
Its capabilities are far
beyond the previous model.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:29.930
And it affects the user's brain

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.930
much more than the old one.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.390
They said this would free man

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:38.760
from "the yoke of the gods," huh?

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:43.100
Those Orpheus Order pig-dogs
sure make me laugh.

00:04:44.360 --> 00:04:45.970
Anyway, where's Kaito?

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:49.300
Ah, sometimes, I have
to let Ana have him.

00:04:49.700 --> 00:04:52.720
It's not very adult of
me to keep him to myself.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.730
Huh? What the heck is that?

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.330
Huh? Where's Ana?

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:10.950
Who's that?

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:11.830
Beats me.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:15.940
This painting's model...

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:17.790
It's you, isn't it?

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.360
Huh? Yeah, it is.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.530
You can tell by looking at that?

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:27.630
It has a touch, a use of color
that is naïve yet beautiful.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:33.560
The model's happy-smiley
spirit is perfectly captured.

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:35.160
"Happy-smiley"?

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:36.310
That's Ana talk.

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:40.200
What's more, the fluffy-smiley
gaze upon the model...

00:05:40.760 --> 00:05:42.940
The artist this really likes you.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:44.630
Um...

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:46.350
Who are you?

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:47.630
Eve!

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:52.450
Eve, sister!

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:55.740
Eve?

00:05:57.280 --> 00:06:00.670
The person who got rid of the spell
that was cast on me...

00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:06.050
The person who freed me, Ana,
from inside that heavy shell...

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:08.800
My precious Eve.

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:10.670
Like he mentioned that time...

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:14.110
It's Eve, it's Eve!

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:16.980
It's been so long, Eve!

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:19.100
It really has been a long time.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:21.230
You seem well, Ana.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.850
Yes, I am!

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.200
Enjoying every day?

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:28.910
They're very fluffy-smiley!

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:29.570
Really?

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:33.410
I see that you're painting.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.300
They're wonderful.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.170
You're getting better and better.

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:41.170
I'm no match for you, Eve.

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:57.430
Eve, I'm no match for
your happy-smiley, fluffy-smiley.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.390
That's...

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:04.700
The picture you drew for
me at Prouder Horse.

00:07:05.990 --> 00:07:08.370
It's a reproduction of a
picture Eve drew for me,

00:07:08.880 --> 00:07:11.700
when I, Ana, forgot how to smile.

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.240
Forgot how to smile?

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:19.660
Eve's paintings have so much
happy-smiley, fluffy-smiley!

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:21.290
So...

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:26.000
I, Ana, remembered how to smile.

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:28.460
Yes, that...

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:30.850
That happened, didn't it?

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:35.890
Eve!

00:07:41.090 --> 00:07:42.610
Don't touch me.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:44.090
You're filthy.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.580
I do not live...

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.290
for your sake!

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:26.650
I am... I...

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:35.330
That's...

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:37.370
An Orpheus Ring!

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:44.590
I'm gonna teach you.

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:47.880
No matter how cold your heart may get,

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.370
it will make it nice and warm.

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:52.760
It's that kind of charm.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:55.760
Happy-smiley, fluffy-smiley...

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:58.760
Happy-smiley, fluffy-smiley...

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:02.160
Happy-smiley, fluffy-smiley...

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:05.570
Happy-smiley, fluffy-smiley...

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:08.650
Sis...

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:11.780
What is it, Ana?

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.650
Draw a happy-smiley picture.

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.000
Done!

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:27.670
Here, Ana.

00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:38.930
Fluffy-smiley, happy-smiley!

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:40.550
Ana!

00:09:42.080 --> 00:09:44.430
Fluffy-smiley, happy-smiley!

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:55.440
Kaito Daimon, I would
have you attempt my game.

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:56.580
Why...

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:00.780
Why would Ana's sister
be in the Orpheus Order?

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:03.680
That's an unpleasant way of putting it.

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:05.600
I'm Ana's sister, so what?

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:07.290
But I am me.

00:10:07.760 --> 00:10:10.750
Don't speak to me using
Ana as comparison.

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:17.260
As long as Ana lives,
I will never be free.

00:10:17.620 --> 00:10:21.810
It's Ana's self-complacency that has

00:10:21.810 --> 00:10:26.680
ripped my life to pieces.

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:31.020
He made me throw away my dream
of becoming a painter!

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:35.110
What's with that face?

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.230
You have some idea what
I'm saying, right?

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.950
Or have you forgotten how to smile again?

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:45.490
Not that it has anything to do with me.

00:10:45.690 --> 00:10:46.750
What?!

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:50.300
Kaito, if you lose this game,

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:53.490
Ana will never paint again.

00:10:53.490 --> 00:10:54.500
What was that?!

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.530
I'll break his arms,

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:02.560
and follow him everywhere.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:04.260
Count on it.

00:11:04.610 --> 00:11:05.890
Mizerka!

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:08.720
And you're fine with that?!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:10.520
Of course.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.060
I see...

00:11:14.920 --> 00:11:17.150
I accept this game!

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:20.650
I won't forgive you, Orpheus Order!

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:45.010
I never thought this would be
how we would meet again.

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:51.060
Or that it would be to exact revenge.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:55.150
I'm sorry for getting
you involved, Mizerka.

00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:58.680
It's all right; it was my suggestion.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:00.650
I want to help.

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:02.620
Thank you.

00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:08.530
Ana stole painting from me,
and I won't forgive him.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:13.120
I will erase him and Kaito
Daimon from within me.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:16.610
Good luck, Eve.

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:20.050
I will see you through this, as a friend,

00:12:20.360 --> 00:12:22.750
as a member of this Orpheus Order

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:26.540
and as a fellow Phi-Brain child.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:37.190
Are you ready?

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:38.520
Yeah.

00:12:51.610 --> 00:12:53.370
Wh..What's this?

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:01.630
This is the puzzle you will attempt.

00:13:02.190 --> 00:13:03.460
The rules are simple.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:06.260
You start at 11:45.

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:10.540
If in fifteen minutes all pieces in place

00:13:10.540 --> 00:13:12.890
to create a single picture,

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:14.220
you win.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.770
A layout puzzle, huh?

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:20.400
It's been a while since I've painted.

00:13:20.720 --> 00:13:23.150
This is for you, Ana.

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:28.990
Puzzle time...

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:30.410
Let's begin.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:36.960
Th..This is...

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:55.510
They're all completely back!

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:58.850
How's he supposed to put them together?!

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:01.360
At first glance, they're
all black, but...

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.280
It's a combination of multiple colors.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.730
My only shot is to go by the brushstrokes

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:09.740
and the subtle mixes of color.

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:12.860
The theory behind jigsaw puzzles

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:15.810
is to find the four corner pieces first,

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:18.580
but that won't work here.

00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:21.840
Just gotta do it!

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:24.500
Which fits this piece?

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:29.720
No!

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:31.600
This piece?

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:33.350
No!

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:35.260
Kaito...

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.850
I painted this for you, you know.

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:40.850
You should be a little happier.

00:14:41.290 --> 00:14:44.100
Or have you truly forgotten?

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:45.400
Your smile?

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.240
Eve!

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:48.280
You have some nerve.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:52.040
You carry on freely, without
thought for my suffering!

00:14:52.510 --> 00:14:54.080
You make me sick!

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:58.130
That painting...

00:14:58.130 --> 00:14:59.290
What is it, Ana?

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:00.950
"That painting"?

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.040
Oh, that's right!

00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:08.340
You can see a painting's design
even when it's broken into pieces.

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:12.460
You know what it will look
like when it's done, right?

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:17.140
As always, your talent
is slightly unsettling.

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:21.690
But that talent stole painting from me!

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:24.190
All right, next up...

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:27.650
This one's qualities make
it easy to identify.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.940
But which one goes with it?

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:31.570
Which one?!

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:36.030
I was the one who taught Ana to paint.

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:40.270
When my painting brought
Ana's smile back,

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:42.450
he awakened to the joy of painting.

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:46.250
Of course, at first they were
just childish scribblings,

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:47.550
but...

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:52.880
His incredible talent suddenly flourished,
surpassing me.

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:58.270
Ana's paintings had a
sparkle that mine lacked.

00:15:59.070 --> 00:16:02.140
A sparkle that captured the
heart and held on tight.

00:16:02.750 --> 00:16:07.020
It was the sparkle of a soul that was free,
free with abandon.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:09.330
A free spirit.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:13.360
But no matter how much one seeks it,
it cannot be obtained.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.780
So I threw my paintbrushes away.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:20.590
Do you understand?

00:16:21.130 --> 00:16:23.420
I was made a stepping stone
for my younger brother.

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:25.540
My humiliation...

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.670
My anger!

00:16:27.610 --> 00:16:28.580
I hate you!

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.850
That free spirit of yours!

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:34.680
I hate your freedom so
much I can't stand it!

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:37.680
What does that mean?

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:39.260
Why compare yourself to him?

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:40.600
What was that?

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:43.850
Ana is Ana and you're you, right?

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.290
Why do you hold yourself down and

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.480
then put the blame for that on Ana?!

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:50.770
It was Ana who did this!

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:52.740
What's with that look?

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:55.600
Are you crawling back into your shell,

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.490
keeping quiet like the old days?

00:16:57.760 --> 00:16:59.660
I won't allow that.

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.060
Apologize!

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:05.490
Scrape your forehead on the ground
and beg my forgiveness!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.130
Th...This is...

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:13.380
Do it, hurry!

00:17:14.030 --> 00:17:16.240
This painting, Ana...

00:17:16.240 --> 00:17:17.390
Ana...

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:20.890
No, you can't apologize!

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:22.930
Ana did nothing wrong.

00:17:22.930 --> 00:17:26.770
He doesn't have to apologize
for your warped sense of anger!

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:28.860
Happy-smiley...

00:17:30.550 --> 00:17:32.740
Happy-smiley, fluffy-smiley.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:35.450
What? What are you up to?

00:17:36.010 --> 00:17:37.470
It's the charm.

00:17:37.470 --> 00:17:39.400
You taught me, Eve.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:42.620
It makes a cold heart nice and warm.

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:44.410
Cut the crap!

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:47.370
Suddenly spewing some
random talk like that...

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:48.880
Just how naïve are you?!

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:55.090
Through something like that, my heart...

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.050
My heart!

00:18:07.090 --> 00:18:08.190
I don't wanna solve this!

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.690
I've had enough.

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:12.690
No more of this puzzle!

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:15.450
But if I don't solve it, Ana will...

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:17.700
You can solve it!

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:20.820
Kaito!

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:23.580
Solve it, Kaito!

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:30.210
Kaito!

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:05.450
This is...

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.080
the last one!

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:33.980
What is that terrible painting?

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:37.610
It's what Eve thinks of me, Ana.

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:40.700
It was empty.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:42.150
Kaito!

00:19:42.550 --> 00:19:44.780
Your puzzle had nothin' in it.

00:19:45.180 --> 00:19:46.450
It was empty.

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.520
The painting was the same as your puzzle.

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:52.410
The paintings you do now
are empty, aren't they?

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:57.290
But I don't think that's the real you.

00:19:57.690 --> 00:20:00.920
It's not the person who
got Ana his smile back.

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:06.300
Enemy of Eve!

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:08.510
Stop!

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:14.200
Stop, that's enough.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:15.940
Enough...

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:17.440
Eve...

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:33.210
I'm sorry, sister Eve.

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:35.290
I'm sorry.

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:36.710
I'm sorry!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.490
Eve's Ring was a Replica.

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:49.330
Eve was an experiment.

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:52.060
I believed in her,

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:56.270
that she was like me, a Phi-Brain child.

00:20:58.920 --> 00:21:01.190
That was a hell of a
disaster, huh, Kaito?

00:21:01.590 --> 00:21:02.560
Yeah.

00:21:02.560 --> 00:21:04.440
But it's all right now.

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:06.370
She's been freed from the Ring,

00:21:06.370 --> 00:21:08.280
and the distortion to her thoughts

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:10.250
and reasoning has completely cleared.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:13.300
The POG will take
responsibility for her and

00:21:13.300 --> 00:21:15.180
protect her from the Orpheus Order.

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.380
We're countin' on ya, Maze.

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:23.200
I'll never be as good as you, but...

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:26.720
I'm going to try painting again.

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:29.370
I like your paintings, Ana.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.140
I want to see more of them.

00:21:31.540 --> 00:21:34.130
So, draw more and more, okay?

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:37.520
See you.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:46.880
It's a lie.

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:49.700
I, Ana, can tell.

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:53.620
Eve won't paint anymore.

00:21:55.310 --> 00:21:58.750
We can't see Eve's drawings anymore.

00:21:59.820 --> 00:22:00.730
Ana...

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:05.770
Kaito!

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:10.430
I, Ana, liked them do much!

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:14.250
It's your turn now.

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:19.100
Use your painting to get your
sister's true smile back.

00:22:19.750 --> 00:22:20.480
Okay...

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:40.050
Eiyuukidori
Playing the hero

00:22:40.050 --> 00:22:44.940
Itsudatte shinjita muteki no kankaku
A sense of invincibility you always believed in

00:22:45.550 --> 00:22:51.370
Tatakatte iru no wa chikyuu no tame nanka ja nai
You're not fighting for the sake of the world or anything

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:54.160
Motto maipeesu de
It's for a more leisurely

00:22:54.160 --> 00:22:59.230
Sou, motto shoujiki na onegai no tame
Yeah, more straightforward request

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:07.670
Nandotonaku kizutsuitemo tachiagare, hero
Even if you're wounded over and over, rise up, hero

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:13.220
Kitto daijoubu, kimi o mamorunda
It's sure to be all right, I'll protect you

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:17.040
Machigai da to shitemo tomarenai
Even if it's wrong, it can't be stopped

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:20.650
Seikai ka nante wakaranai
I don't know if it's the right answer

00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:24.660
Donna toki demo original ni
No matter the situation

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:27.400
Step o fumidashiteku
I'll take those first steps, originally

00:23:27.400 --> 00:23:30.770
Dramatic ni, mawaru sekai de
On this spinning world, I'm searching, dramatically

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:34.430
Kiwameita wonder sagashiteru
For wonders that sparkle

00:23:35.190 --> 00:23:38.430
Boku, shijou saikou no tabi o tsuzukeyou
Me, I'll keep going on the greatest journey in history

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:42.740
Image shite shiawase na mirai e
To the happy future I imagined

00:23:44.430 --> 00:23:46.060
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:51.380
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:51.380 --> 00:23:52.800
Mirai e
To the future

00:23:54.710 --> 00:23:56.260
(Mirai e)
(To the future)

00:24:02.190 --> 00:24:05.140
I will challenge Kaito
Daimon to this final game.

00:24:05.140 --> 00:24:06.320
Don't bother.

00:24:06.320 --> 00:24:07.800
You're settin' yourself up to fail.

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.380
I haven't yet given my all!

00:24:11.160 --> 00:24:13.760
And now I know, the way
to beat him, that is!

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:15.490
Wh..What'd you say?

00:24:15.490 --> 00:24:16.600
Just what is it?!

00:24:16.600 --> 00:24:18.960
Next time, "Pinochle's Resolve"

00:24:18.080 --> 00:24:26.670
Pinochle's Resolve

00:24:18.960 --> 00:24:22.470
Kaito Daimon, I shall
rise above these glasses!

00:24:22.460 --> 00:24:23.480
So that's it?!
